mily from starving\u2014how can he now evade all manner of obstacles and acquire high-quality food in large enough quantities to satisfy his newfound partners, the renowned gourmet cockroaches? There will be troublemakers stirring up the trash, destroying food, and even attacking the Artie himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gourmet cockroaches\u2019 tastes will only grow more refined. The Artie\u2019s stamina is limited, and as time goes on, he must make decisions faster than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578500/extras/c614d9ea6cfe6e1f1f9ba75506aea32a.poster.avif?t=1751336572\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578500/extras/c614d9ea6cfe6e1f1f9ba75506aea32a.webm?t=1751336572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578500/extras/c614d9ea6cfe6e1f1f9ba75506aea32a.mp4?t=1751336572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, his fate is in your hands. Can his story end in a happy ending?</p>",
